  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Implementation of the European Union Election Observation Mission (EU EOM) to Sao Tome and Principe 2022</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the project is the implementation of logistics, security, financial and administrative aspects of the 2022 EU EOM to Sao Tome and Principe, for the General Elections, scheduled for the 25th of September 2022. IOM will select a team of experts (Project Manager, Operations Expert, Security Expert, IT Expert, Finance &amp; Contract Expert) who will be deployed to Sao Tome from mid-August to mid-October to implement the mission. The EOM will be composed by a Chief Observer, a Core Team of 8 members and 10 Long Term Observers and 18 Short Term Observers. IOM will have no visibility in the project.</narrative>
  </description>
